LoginAutomation — Project Synopsis
1️.Project Title

LoginAutomation — Automated Login Testing Framework using Selenium WebDriver, Java & TestNG

2️. Introduction

Automation testing uses scripts and tools to execute test cases and verify application behavior with minimal manual effort.
LoginAutomation is a focused Selenium project that automates and validates the login functionality of a web application and related post-login behaviours. The framework is designed to be modular, maintainable, and suitable for inclusion in CI/CD pipelines.

3️. Objective

The primary objectives of this project are:

Automate the login functionality for the target web application.

Validate successful login and post-login dashboard visibility.

Validate negative/invalid-login scenarios.

Capture evidence (screenshots) on failures.

Make tests data-driven so credentials and scenarios can be supplied from external sources (Excel/CSV).

Provide TestNG suite execution and clear test reporting.

